{"title":"sketches from winter, spring, to summer","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/sketchbook-winter-spring-to-summer","date":1784215431000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c06daf94-eb44-4cb2-bddb-4f91adc3357a/winterspringsummer2026.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual</strong></a><strong> work</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p>some pages from my sketchbook that I made these last months, which were such a blur. these moments ground me in beauty I saw, felt, made. before this: was <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/drawing-through-a-life-rupture\" target=\"_blank\">drawing through a life rupture</a>. <br /></p><p><strong>WINTER, NORTH CAROLINA:</strong> I was obsessed with the <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/blue-tree-shadows-on-sun-lit-snow\" target=\"_blank\">blue tree shadows on sunlit snow</a>; they gave me so much peace in an anxious time. I used watercolor pencils. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b931dcce-8486-47f3-893b-93566294e975/treeshadow.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>SPRING, NORTH CAROLINA:</strong> I remember I made this right after my first hypnotherapy session with my friend <a href=\"https://lenayin.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Lena</a>, in which I connected to my inner child and gave her what she didn’t have, but really needed… it was also shortly after a huge existential conflict moment I had with my partner. I used my old prismacolor pastels I had from 10th grade. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/1f26f023-6f66-4333-b075-34e55e8f0746/spring+storm.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>SPRING, ANN ARBOR:</strong> I painted this after a tango marathon weekend in Ann Arbor, at a coffee shop. I was using my watercolor aquarelle pastels for the first time. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79950968-e01a-47c1-9901-4e32abc14d87/IMG_9547.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>SPRING, MINNEAPOLIS:</strong> I drew these tulips in pencil — which were bright yellow and on my friend Karen’s table. I was feeling horrible, not at all colorful, so I made them black and white. there is a raven on the other side. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c9e53779-2e14-49fa-a953-b9384b8a38d3/IMG_9572.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>LATE SPRING, NORTH CAROLINA</strong>: I painted my mother’s tomato plants, with a prismacolor water soluable black pencil. which I share in more detail <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/hello-sun-shadow-tomato-plant\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fe434b20-3d9a-4cbe-a82d-493fc73a10a3/tomato2.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>SUMMER, MARSEILLE:</strong> I painted this using watercolor pencils at 9pm on my friend Zeynep’s terrace, after having sprayed a lot of mosquito spray. I share more process shots <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/hello-from-marseille\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/5e8dc9a5-6ac8-42af-8b06-520679b784f2/vieuxport-3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>SUMMER, MARSEILLE:</strong> I drew and painted this very spontaneously on the day that my friend Zeynep, her baby and husband left the house — leaving me alone here. I was super exhausted and just wanted to paint something, and this emerged. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aeb18008-4f8f-4bb6-8f32-58f2a0ec237e/IMG_0201.jpeg?format=1500w 150